+</style></head><body><main class="app"><header class="topbar"><div class="brand"><div class="logo">D</div>daymark</div><div class="actions"><button class="secondary" id="undoBtn" disabled>↶ Undo</button><div class="menu"><button class="icon-btn" id="menuBtn" aria-label="Board options" aria-expanded="false">···</button><div class="menu-pop" id="menuPop"><button id="exportBtn">⇩ Export board</button><button id="importBtn">⇧ Import backup</button><button id="archiveBtn">▤ Show archive</button><button id="themeBtn">◐ Toggle appearance</button><input id="fileInput" type="file" accept="application/json,.json" hidden></div></div></div></header><section class="intro"><div><h1>My board</h1><p>A little progress, every day.</p></div><div class="stats" id="stats"></div></section><div class="toolbar"><label class="search"><span>⌕</span><input class="field" id="search" type="search" placeholder="Find a task…" aria-label="Search tasks"></label><select class="field" id="labelFilter" aria-label="Filter by label"><option value="">All labels</option></select><select class="field" id="sort" aria-label="Sort tasks"><option value="manual">Board order</option><option value="due">Due date</option><option value="created">Recently added</option></select><div class="spacer"></div><button class="secondary" id="clearFilters">Clear filters</button></div><section class="board" id="board" aria-label="Kanban board"></section><div class="keyboard">Tip: drag cards between columns · <kbd>N</kbd> creates a task · <kbd>/</kbd> searches</div></main><div class="modal-back" id="modalBack"><section class="modal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="modalTitle"><h2 id="modalTitle">New task</h2><form id="taskForm"><div class="form-row"><label for="titleInput">Task name</label><input id="titleInput" maxlength="140" required placeholder="What needs doing?"></div><div class="form-row"><label for="descInput">Notes</label><textarea id="descInput" maxlength="3000" placeholder="Add details, links, or ne